5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! Let's make sure we have a solid plan this time. I want to know exactly what we're dealing with before we pick a number.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It would be wise to understand the current atmosphere and how people are feeling about attending our gatherings.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We need to stop guessing. I want to see who is actually showing up and who is just coasting on the others' hard work.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should also consider the administrative burden. The person managing the money shouldn't be overwhelmed by the system we choose.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I just hope we don't make it too scary for new people to join. We should see why some folks don't sign up.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, that's a good point. I'll look into the money side of things to see what we can actually count on.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'm interested in the patterns of attendance. Perhaps the sign-in sheets or the weekday turnout would be revealing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm going for the sign-in sheets and the rota. I want to see the gap between the regulars and the ghosts.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the treasurer's hours and the mid-year joiner records to see where the time is being wasted.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the taster evening forms and the bank statements to see how people prefer to pay.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
